# This repository intentionally publishes only the static client preview and
# the small set of repository-management files listed below.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/pages.yml
!static-preview/
!static-preview/**

# Local and generated files must never be committed.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*~
**/__pycache__/
**/.cache/
**/node_modules/
